oad stock  industries arc reactor sending a surge  of electricity through stained suit and  killing the man inside  the star wars franchise contains  numerous examples of mentors coming to  blows with their proteges a prime  example takes place during the last jedi  in which kylo ren and his uncle luke  skywalker face off in battle kylo was  known as ben solo when he was sent to  train with luke to become a jedi sadly  supreme leader snoke soon wormed his way  into the young apprentice's head luring  him to the dark side when ben woke up  one night to find luke standing over him  with a lightsaber he lashed out in fear  and confusion finally giving up on the  light side of the force by the time he  meets luke again kylo has killed snoke  and taken over as supreme leader of the  first order he initially tries to use  the first order's overwhelming firepower  to kill his one-time master  do you think you got him when luke  emerges unscathed kylo engages him in a  lightsaber duel one that is made all the  more intense by their fractured  relationship at first the crazed kylo  struggles to land a blow on the wise  jedi and when he eventually manages to  run his weapon through him he realizes  that luke isn't really there he's  projecting himself to give the  resistance time to escape  his ruse uncovered luke vanishes he then  passes away from the effort of his  projection confident that the resistance  and the jedi will live on  while the title character is the focus  of doctor strange his pursuit of the  magical arts place him in the middle of  a struggle between his mentor the  ancient one and her former student  cacillius while strange is told that  cassilius wants to bring dormammu from  the dark dimension to earth in a bid to  give everyone eternal life he isn't told  why cecilia's turned against the ancient  one as it turns out cassilius became  disenchanted with the ancient one when  he learned that she has been drawing  power from the dark dimension to extend  her life because of this betrayal when  the ancient one tells cassilius that  bringing dormammu to earth will end in  pain he doesn't believe her eventually  strange and his ally mordo are forced to  fight cassilius in the mirror dimension  just when it seems as though they're  outmatched the ancient one appears  pushing her current proteges to the side  and taking on cassilius and his  followers alone she gets the upper hand  at first but cecilia stabs her in the  abdomen and kicks her through a portal  into the real world where she falls to  the ground from several stories up  despite strange's best efforts nothing  can be done to save her  rocky 5 begins with rocky balboa  reveling in his win over ivan drago  which took place in the previous movie  but he and his family soon fall on hard  times the head trauma he suffered in the  ring has forced him to retire from  boxing and to make matters worse his  accountant has squandered all of his  money so rocky decides to move back to  his old rough and tumble philadelphia  neighborhood where he reopens his late  trainer mickey's gym it's here that  rocky meets tommy gunn a boxer who all  but begs rocky to train and manage him  man i'm sorry but what do you think well  i think i don't think you listen too  good but you you fight you brawl like  you was a street fighter inspired by his  memories of mickey rocky agrees and  quickly becomes preoccupied with tommy's  career he ushers tommy to success but  tommy grows resentful when he realizes  that he's seen as little more than an  avatar of rocky himself at the same time  slimy promoter george washington duke  starts bending tommy's ear about the  riches he could amass if george took  over his management tommy goes for the  deal but after winning a championship  and being told it means nothing because  he didn't beat rocky he goes to rocky's  gym and calls him out when tommy refuses  to back down rocky challenges him to a  street fight while rocky easily beats  his protege at first tommy attacks from  behind and practically knocks his former  mentor out of course rocky quickly comes  back and eventually triumphs proving to  everyone that he's the real champion  early on in chiang chi and the legend of  the ten rings the protagonist is known  simply as sean nobody in his adopted  home of san francisco is aware that sean  is actually shang chi the son of shu  wenwu owner of the titular rings and  head of a criminal empire his reasons  for keeping his family a secret are  understandable after his mother was  killed his dad started to treat him like  a member of his personal army training  him to be a killer when the opportunity  arose the traumatized chongqi ran away  from home a decade later wen wu finds  shang qi and takes him back to his  compound by force shanxi doesn't believe  his father when he tells him that he's  been hearing his mother's voice who is  claiming she's held captive in her  homeland of tallow concerned chongqi  goes to tallow ahead of wenwu and learns  that his father is being fooled by the  soul-eating dweller in darkness who the  community is keeping sealed behind a  gate when wenwu arrives at talo and  attempts to break that gate chongqi  stands in his way the powerful winwood  gets the better of his son to begin with  but chongqi re-engages him and they have  a dramatic one-on-one battle win woo  manages to release the dweller in  darkness however and quickly realizes he  was wrong all along during the final  showdown wini sacrifices his life for  his son passing on the rings before he  dies  when the unnamed main character of fight  club meets tyler durden he's feeling  smothered by a society that prizes  material possessions over more prime  allergens tyler a compulsive man who  rails against the institutions that bind  becomes his guru by offering him a way  to rid himself of society's shackles  together they create the titular fight  club which gives the narrator the  cathartic opportunity to get his  aggressions out it isn't until well into  the movie when the narrator finally  begins to question tyler's motives that  he realizes his mentor is actually a  disassociated personality he created to  deal with his disillusionment when the  narrator wakes up after a blackout and  discovers that tyler has made plans to  blow up a series of buildings he  attempts to stop it from happening  however since tyler is always right  there with him he inevitably fights back  against the narrator to everyone else it  looks like the narrator is beating  himself to a bloody pulp and throwing  himself downstairs but to the narrator  tyler is doing it all when the narrator  comes to the realization that he really  does hold power over tyler he gains  control of tyler's gun and shoots  himself in the cheek finally eradicating  his other personality that said it's  tyler who really gets the last laugh  before the release of revenge of the  sith there may have been no single event  in movie history more anticipated than  the transformation of anakin skywalker  into darth vader he betrayed and  murdered your father  [Music]  now the jedi are all but extinct star  wars fans learned vader's backstory in  the original trilogy but it took more  than 20 years to see it play out on  screen the incident that precipitates  anakin's final transformation involves a  fight with his mentor the jedi master  obi-wan kenobi earlier in the movie  anakin falls to the dark side and is  dubbed darth vader but it's not until he  fights obi-wan on the fiery planet  mustafar that he becomes the black suit  clad baddie that fans love to hate  learning of anakin's embrace of the dark  side obi-wan enlists his wife padme to  help turn him back to the light when  they reach mustafar padme tries to  reason with anakin but when he sees  obi-wan he concludes she's betrayed him  demonstrating he's beyond saving anakin  force chokes padme and then battles  obi-wan in an epic lightsaber duel  across the lava world he is blind with  rage but obi-wan still manages to beat  him eventually cutting off anakin's legs  as well as one of his arms leaving him  broken and consumed by flames despite  this vader survives and many years later  finally kills his one-time master and  another lightsaber duel  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

